{"seq":1,"slug":"the-way-of-cultivation","title":"The Way Of Cultivation","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/the-way-of-cultivation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"daily-self-examination","title":"每日的省察","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/the-way-of-cultivation/daily-self-examination","wordCount":2253,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"sincerity-and-reverence","title":"诚与敬","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/the-way-of-cultivation/sincerity-and-reverence","wordCount":2134,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现曾国藩的修身之道。&quot;每日的省察&quot;——以写日记的方式，每日严厉地反省、克治自己的缺点与私欲——是曾国藩修身方法的核心。而&quot;诚&quot;（真诚不自欺）、&quot;敬&quot;（敬畏专注）、&quot;慎独&quot;（独处不苟）则是其修身的根本，深刻地承袭了儒家（理学）的修身传统。本章揭示曾国藩作为儒家修身传统集大成者的修身之道。</p>\n"}